## 7. Clearance Constraint Map (pre-generation)
- Blocked morphology: -ai, -agent, -tech, -cloud, -labs, -digital, -systems,
  -platform, -automation, -dex, -nova, -vela, -vora, -vent, -tril.
- Blocked shapes: pharma endings (-ex/-in/-am/-zol/-pril/-mab/-tinib/-statin),
  personal-name shapes (-ov/-ski/-sen/-us), vowel-final coined,
  two-word neutral semantic pairs, fantasy morphology.
- Required architecture: one word, 6–10 letters, 2–4 syllables, semantically
  light, ID+EN pronunciation stable, hearing→spelling recoverable, no obvious
  ordinary meaning, no obvious cultural/religious/geographic anchor.

